in-based custard filling. The pumpkin and pumpkin pie are both a symbol of harvest time, and pumpkin pie is generally eaten during the fall and early winter. In the United States and Canada it is usually prepared for Thanksgiving, Christmas, and other occasions when pumpkin is in season. Pumpkin is in season generally from mid-October through November. Harvest occurs during October which is just in time for Thanksgiving."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-pumpkin-pie"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pumpkin_pie"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["American cuisine","cuisine/american-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":13,"links":[["Allspice","ingredient/allspice"],["Butter","ingredient/butter"],["Cinnamon","ingredient/cinnamon"],["Clove","ingredient/clove"],["Condensed milk","ingredient/condensed-milk"],["Egg","ingredient/egg"],["Ginger","ingredient/ginger"],["Maple syrup","ingredient/maple-syrup"],["Nutmeg","ingredient/nutmeg"],["Pumpkin","ingredient/pumpkin"],["Shortcrust pastry","ingredient/shortcrust-pastry"],["Sugar","ingredient/sugar"],["Wheat flour","ingredient/wheat-flour"]]},{"h":"More from American cuisine","links":[["Angel food cake","dish/angel-food-cake"],["Banana bread","dish/banana-bread"],["Banana pudding","dish/banana-pudding"],["Barbecue sauce","dish/barbecue-sauce"],["Beer cake","dish/beer-cake"],["Better than sex cake","dish/better-than-sex-cake"],["Blini","dish/blini"],["Blooming onion","dish/blooming-onion"],["Brown Betty (dessert)","dish/brown-betty-dessert"],["Brunswick stew","dish/brunswick-stew"],["Buffalo wing","dish/buffalo-wing"],["Butter cake","dish/butter-cake"],["Caesar salad","dish/caesar-salad"],["Caramel apple","dish/caramel-apple"],["Carbonara","dish/carbonara"],["Cheesesteak","dish/cheesesteak"],["Chicago-style hot dog","dish/chicago-style-hot-dog"],["Chicken nugget","dish/chicken-nugget"],["Chiffon cake","dish/chiffon-cake"],["Chili con carne","dish/chili-con-carne"],